  "formula": "duration multiplier = 1 - 0.001 * min(clamp(derived Weapons stat, 0, 200), 100)",
  "pipeline": "weapon reload stat contributions -> 0..100 weapon-stat clamp -> weapon-specific seconds curve -> independent animation multipliers -> Weapons duration multiplier",
  "implementation": [
    "weapon_stat_reload contributes to reload_animation/weapons_stat with its own named factor chorus_d2:weapons_reload_duration; MAX and one stacking key make duplicate providers idempotent",
    "Character Weapons points never add to the weapon Reload Speed stat; a weapon at 100 Reload Speed can still receive the duration multiplier",
    "Armor/Font contribution changes are read only when a reload or insertion is accepted; committed timing and its trace are immutable",
    "Each incremental insertion gets its own accepted timing; the following step reads the then-current armor and perks",
    "Existing draw cancellation, host verification, reserve transfers and unknown-reaction behavior are unchanged; no new engine or checkpoint type"
  ],
